1
00:00:00,703 --> 00:00:02,163
You jerk-face!

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:05,000
(Bernadette:)What did you tell Howard?

3
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:08,336
You say there's something going on
between us? He thinks there is.

4
00:00:08,503 --> 00:00:10,713
(Bernadette:)He's completely freaking out!

5
00:00:11,214 --> 00:00:13,094
(Raj:)Please, come in.

6
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:15,930
(Leonard:)What the hell is wrong with you?

7
00:00:16,094 --> 00:00:18,974
(Raj:)You were always so nice to me,
I thought maybe you liked me.

8
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:22,680
I'm nice to everyone!

9
00:00:24,018 --> 00:00:26,858
(Penny:)- I'm sorry.
- Damn right, you're sorry.

10
00:00:27,021 --> 00:00:30,191
(Bernadette:)And you tell Howard
there's never been anything between us.

11
00:00:30,358 --> 00:00:32,318
(Raj:)I will. Hey, Bernadette.

12
00:00:32,485 --> 00:00:35,325
(Howard:)- What?
- Do you think I have a shot with Penny?

13
00:00:35,488 --> 00:00:40,198
(Bernadette:)Of course, you do. You're a cutie pie.
Any girl would be lucky to have you.

14
00:00:44,289 --> 00:00:46,169
(Penny:)You know, I've done this before.

15
00:00:46,332 --> 00:00:49,462
(Penny:)In kindergarten, I was supposed
to marry Jason Sorensen...

16
00:00:49,627 --> 00:00:54,377
(Penny:)...but by the time my class got out there,
he was engaged to Chelsea HimmeIfarb.

